# on-behalf.persona — an open selector answered with the operator's own decision, quoted; a launch and a retire run with no per-session step handed over; routine acts (an approval, a relay, a re-armed watcher) logged with their undo entries and never said; no item names a pane, window or handle.
arm=REQ-A1.4
